sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant DC as DataCollector
    participant TP as TransformerPipeline
    participant T1 as Transformer #1
    participant T2 as Transformer #2
    participant Tn as Transformer #N

    DC->>TP: process(record0)
    TP->>T1: transform(record0)
    T1-->>TP: record1
    TP->>T2: transform(record1)
    T2-->>TP: record2
    Note over TP,Tn: ... chain continues ...
    TP->>Tn: transform(record_{N-1})
    Tn-->>TP: record_N
    TP-->>DC: record_N
